1
00:00:00,004 --> 00:00:01,534
(Penny:)Bernadette, for every episode
of Doctor Who

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:02,910
(Penny:)Leonard has made me sit through,

3
00:00:02,908 --> 00:00:04,238
(Penny:)I will play on your behalf

4
00:00:04,243 --> 00:00:06,243
(Penny:)and send that TARDIS
back to Gallifrey,

5
00:00:06,245 --> 00:00:08,315
(Penny:)where I hate
that I know it belongs.

6
00:00:08,314 --> 00:00:10,814
(Bernadette:)Yes, Penny
plays for me.

7
00:00:10,816 --> 00:00:13,716
(Howard:)That's not fair--
she has upper body muscles.

8
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:18,090
(Raj:)Dude, three-time
Sanskriti School

9
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:20,820
(Raj:)for Well-Born Boys
badminton champion.

10
00:00:21,793 --> 00:00:23,763
(Howard:)That's right-- okay,
Raj can play for me.

11
00:00:23,762 --> 00:00:25,462
(Amy:)Ooh, you just chose champions.

12
00:00:25,464 --> 00:00:27,464
(Amy:)It's like we're reenacting
the ancient German practice

13
00:00:27,466 --> 00:00:29,466
(Amy:)of trial by combat.
PENNY: Yeah,
it's also like

14
00:00:29,468 --> 00:00:31,768
(Penny:)when the Mountain fought the
Red Viper in Game of Thrones.

15
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:33,500
(Bernadette:)Leonard makes you
watch that, too?

16
00:00:33,506 --> 00:00:35,006
(Penny:)No, no, I like that show.

17
00:00:35,007 --> 00:00:36,737
(Penny:)It's got dragons
and people doing it.

18
00:00:37,809 --> 00:00:39,139
WOLOWITZ:
So it's settled.

19
00:00:39,144 --> 00:00:41,884
(Howard:)The fate of Doctor Who's TARDIS
will be decided

20
00:00:41,881 --> 00:00:44,351
by a Game of Thrones inspired
death-match on the battlefield

21
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:47,350
(Howard:)of ThunderCats
versus Transformers.

22
00:00:47,353 --> 00:00:50,553
(Amy:)If you still have that bra,
I'll give you a nickel for it.

23
00:00:56,361 --> 00:00:59,701
(Sheldon:)There it is.

24
